# 🛒 FurniWorld E-Commerce

FurniWorld is a full-featured e-commerce web application designed for a smooth and modern furniture shopping experience. This project supports product browsing, user authentication, cart management, order processing, and admin functionality.

## 🌐 Tech Stack

### Frontend
- EJS
- Tailwind CSS
- Redux / Context API

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB (Mongoose)
- JWT Authentication
- Bcrypt for password hashing

### Other Tools
- Stripe (for payment integration)
- Cloudinary (for image uploads)
- Docker (containerization)
- Nginx (reverse proxy)
- RabbitMQ (if using microservices/queues)
- GitHub Actions (CI/CD)
- AWS EC2 / Render / Vercel (deployment)

---

## ✨ Features

### 🧑‍💻 User
- Signup / Login
- View products by category
- Search and filter furniture
- Add to cart & manage cart
- Place orders and track status
- Payment integration via Stripe

### 🛠️ Admin
- Add, edit, and delete products
- Manage user accounts
- Manage orders
- View sales reports

---

